<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are searching for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince, while Benin has pledged 2,000 troops to assist in the fight against gangs. President Bukele has deployed 2,000 Salvadoran troops to Haiti and denied accusations that his forces carried out airstrikes. The United Nations reports 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. The postponed presidential election is now scheduled for July 2027, and hunger is worsening as high food prices and El Niño persist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOYVd1ejRXeTFWd2ZCUTFFb1REVWtEQWFXWm9xRENBUVMzVmR3aF8yZTRKalIxVTd1NzdwYmNJUDNnZVlFXzN4RXFxV18wd0NfcDIxQ0ozZXNxaVVBbE1pY1EzWERoeDB2Tk1LSlQwOWhqdUxNckFOWlhpaFpQZl9wVkllNzk1RThBc3NyRm1CeXRwMUpCUl9FTjR6enpvWnlreGVkRkFJVVAyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPYWs1WTNHSG55T1k2WlFQc2tpTnhzcGF5MGNZc0hqazMwUmZ3ZkEtZExqbk03QklMWFZZNkZZSnYzSHI5QjgwN0JMR2hqUXhUa1N1Y0c4ZzRVdnpfenUwOElKS2RyN1huX3M3dVJLVDJCenpKQkRnY3pDdFZEVmFyT3JWaVh4dVl5bGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;San Juan Daily Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPTkstc0NuRHpFUFBoWkp4ZDFVVHhmUU40UFVGODhrSkpfZm9DaVIzSXl4ZmlnTjlINVE0NFVJSHJHUmIzUzJobEIyWHdoSzFKd3dfTW9FRFRzVV8yZm9tQkZXWS1QSU9GSFB6ZzVDNVMwSXRKVG9xZ3IxQWV0VVl5Z09uUWtmVE85TlVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Semafor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOV1lOa3l2ZVllbkk1TVprTHFNUHh6WElwR1NrRUxCbVJJb0xjMWdzZkQxYk9melNfUEVpbWtlS3RCTXFqSTJkZGZKeU1PdzJnR0FoaEZVdnoxX01PSzFZa2E5dlBNXzRzQTFYU1lPUmExY2cwWi1tSmJPOG1yRGZmU0t5SlZDdjMxTkNJMUtrVkFDOXpE